From: Tycho Andersen <tycho.andersen@canonical.com>
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] ebpf: allow BPF_REG_X in src_reg conditional jumps
Date: Fri,  4 Sep 2015 10:04:24 -0600
Message-ID: <1441382664-17437-7-git-send-email-tycho.andersen@canonical.com>
References: <1441382664-17437-1-git-send-email-tycho.andersen@canonical.com>
Cc: Will Drewry <wad@chromium.org>, Oleg Nesterov <oleg@redhat.com>,
	Andy Lutomirski <luto@amacapital.net>,
